  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa 24 Media Video on Demand Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa 24 Media Limited seeks to increase its capacity to create and disseminate positive, informative, and capacity-enhancing content across Africa as well as support USADFs Office of the President in providing graphic design-related services to further enhance USADFs branding standards and visual communication products. Africa 24 will develop and disseminate (i) a 13-part, 15-minute How it Works web series, (ii) a 13-part, 5-minute Agribusiness web series, and (iii) a 13-part, 30-minute Entrepreneurship web series.</narrative>
  </description>
